1
00:00:06,620 --> 00:00:08,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Everyone's responsible
for copyright protection.]</font>

2
00:00:09,290 --> 00:00:14,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪After all the joy and sorrow♪</font>

3
00:00:14,520 --> 00:00:18,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I still recall your face♪</font>

4
00:00:19,710 --> 00:00:25,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪You were by my side;
the cool rain fell♪</font>

5
00:00:25,360 --> 00:00:30,870
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I closed my eyes
and heard you sing gently♪</font>

6
00:00:31,500 --> 00:00:36,150
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I'd wager all
for a love that never ends♪</font>

7
00:00:37,130 --> 00:00:40,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪To keep you forever near♪</font>

8
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:47,590
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪In this vast world,
I wait for your light♪</font>

9
00:00:47,720 --> 00:00:52,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪We'll share this dream
till dawn is bright♪</font>

10
00:00:53,200 --> 00:00:58,510
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪All the riddles of parting
I'll uncover♪</font>

11
00:00:58,820 --> 00:01:01,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪At last, I'll sing, kiss, and hold you♪</font>

12
00:01:01,080 --> 00:01:04,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪The answer is revealed
within your heart♪</font>

13
00:01:09,700 --> 00:01:12,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[The Legendary Chitose-Sama]</font>

14
00:01:12,020 --> 00:01:16,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Episode 2]</font>

15
00:01:18,740 --> 00:01:20,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Performing an autopsy so late?</font>

16
00:01:20,020 --> 00:01:21,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is there really such a rush?</font>

17
00:01:22,180 --> 00:01:23,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Opportunity waits for no one.</font>

18
00:01:23,780 --> 00:01:25,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We must uncover the truth first</font>

19
00:01:25,500 --> 00:01:27,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to present our loyalty
to Princess Changle.</font>

20
00:01:27,700 --> 00:01:28,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We can't let anyone beat us to it.</font>

21
00:01:38,300 --> 00:01:39,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If the Xizhao Princess</font>

22
00:01:39,620 --> 00:01:41,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">was smothered to death,</font>

23
00:01:42,220 --> 00:01:43,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">she would have struggled in distress.</font>

24
00:01:44,740 --> 00:01:46,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yet her fingernails were clean,</font>

25
00:01:46,820 --> 00:01:48,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">showing no signs of a fight.</font>

26
00:01:49,580 --> 00:01:50,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Could it be someone she trusted</font>

27
00:01:51,020 --> 00:01:51,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">who did this to her?</font>

28
00:01:52,300 --> 00:01:53,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I must inspect the crime scene.</font>

29
00:01:53,700 --> 00:01:55,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Official Residence
is heavily guarded now.</font>

30
00:01:55,700 --> 00:01:56,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Going there would draw all eyes</font>

31
00:01:56,980 --> 00:01:57,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">directly to you.</font>

32
00:01:58,100 --> 00:01:59,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I have a way to go unnoticed.</font>

33
00:02:03,140 --> 00:02:04,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Everyone, come and collect your share!</font>

34
00:02:04,540 --> 00:02:05,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Jinyu Chamber]
These are all sent by the Prince</font>

35
00:02:05,500 --> 00:02:07,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Jinyu Chamber]
as daily supplies for you.</font>

36
00:02:07,540 --> 00:02:09,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You can't get these in Xizhao!</font>

37
00:02:09,220 --> 00:02:09,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me see.</font>

38
00:02:10,140 --> 00:02:10,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Careful there.</font>

39
00:02:11,140 --> 00:02:11,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Don't spill it.
- Thank you.</font>

40
00:02:14,460 --> 00:02:15,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Look at this one.</font>

41
00:02:17,580 --> 00:02:19,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sir, you've worked hard these days.</font>

42
00:02:19,940 --> 00:02:20,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Prince was concerned</font>

43
00:02:21,020 --> 00:02:22,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and sent me to offer his regards.</font>

44
00:02:23,140 --> 00:02:23,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thank you.</font>

45
00:02:38,260 --> 00:02:38,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness,</font>

46
00:02:38,980 --> 00:02:40,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jun Qinglan is not at Yizhuang,</font>

47
00:02:40,300 --> 00:02:41,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">nor at the Court of Judicial Review.</font>

48
00:02:43,020 --> 00:02:43,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Keep searching.</font>

49
00:02:43,660 --> 00:02:44,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes.</font>

50
00:02:55,460 --> 00:02:55,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's go</font>

51
00:02:58,140 --> 00:02:58,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to Jinyu Chamber.</font>

52
00:02:59,500 --> 00:02:59,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes.</font>

53
00:03:01,380 --> 00:03:05,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Jinyu Chamber]</font>

54
00:03:07,220 --> 00:03:08,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">His Highness has arrived.</font>

55
00:03:13,420 --> 00:03:14,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Please, have a seat, Your Highness.</font>

56
00:03:20,540 --> 00:03:22,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You are
all the Princess's trusted aides.</font>

57
00:03:23,220 --> 00:03:24,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Prince Duan is considerate of everyone</font>

58
00:03:25,460 --> 00:03:26,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and made a special trip
to offer his regards.</font>

59
00:03:29,820 --> 00:03:30,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Please.</font>

60
00:03:36,780 --> 00:03:38,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Good thing my men slipped away quickly.</font>

61
00:03:39,420 --> 00:03:41,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But Li Congyao would never be</font>

62
00:03:41,420 --> 00:03:42,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">so attentive without a reason.</font>

63
00:03:43,820 --> 00:03:45,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's his real game here?</font>

64
00:03:46,500 --> 00:03:49,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I must report this to Changle at once.</font>

65
00:03:49,860 --> 00:03:50,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qinglan,</font>

66
00:03:50,700 --> 00:03:52,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">are you truly set on serving Changle?</font>

67
00:03:52,740 --> 00:03:54,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It has long been my dearest wish.</font>

68
00:03:54,740 --> 00:03:55,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Stop.</font>

69
00:03:56,380 --> 00:03:56,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sir,</font>

70
00:03:57,220 --> 00:03:59,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I need to examine
the Xizhao Princess's body.</font>

71
00:03:59,340 --> 00:04:00,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'd be grateful for your help.</font>

72
00:04:00,340 --> 00:04:00,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Orders from above:</font>

73
00:04:01,060 --> 00:04:01,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Unless His Majesty comes in person,</font>

74
00:04:02,060 --> 00:04:02,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">no one</font>

75
00:04:02,940 --> 00:04:04,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">may approach the Xizhao Princess's body.</font>

76
00:04:07,460 --> 00:04:08,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He must have found out I used his name</font>

77
00:04:08,820 --> 00:04:10,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to investigate at Jinyu Chamber.</font>

78
00:04:11,060 --> 00:04:12,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He did this on purpose.</font>

79
00:04:12,940 --> 00:04:15,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Every step from now on will be hard.</font>

80
00:04:46,260 --> 00:04:46,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What are you looking at?</font>

81
00:04:50,100 --> 00:04:52,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This courtyard is beautifully decorated.</font>

82
00:04:53,100 --> 00:04:53,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Indeed.</font>

83
00:04:54,100 --> 00:04:55,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Prince specifically ordered</font>

84
00:04:55,060 --> 00:04:56,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">this courtyard to match
the General's Mansion</font>

85
00:04:56,620 --> 00:04:57,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">in Guanzhou down to the last detail.</font>

86
00:04:58,660 --> 00:04:59,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Prince is so sentimental.</font>

87
00:05:00,180 --> 00:05:02,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He must be a deeply devoted man.</font>

88
00:05:03,540 --> 00:05:04,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ms. Jun, please. The Prince awaits you.</font>

89
00:05:39,540 --> 00:05:40,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why are you bathing?</font>

90
00:05:43,620 --> 00:05:44,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What else would I be doing?</font>

91
00:05:44,860 --> 00:05:47,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">May I ask why you summoned me?</font>

92
00:05:53,340 --> 00:05:54,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you sure you want
to speak to me like that?</font>

93
00:05:55,700 --> 00:05:56,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then please, finish your bath first.</font>

94
00:05:56,940 --> 00:05:57,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Stop.</font>

95
00:05:57,900 --> 00:05:58,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Did I say you could leave?</font>

96
00:06:00,740 --> 00:06:01,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come and help me dress.</font>

97
00:06:03,340 --> 00:06:04,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Think carefully.</font>

98
00:06:05,020 --> 00:06:05,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is there perhaps something</font>

99
00:06:05,980 --> 00:06:06,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you wish to ask of me?</font>

100
00:06:07,580 --> 00:06:08,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If I'm in a good mood,</font>

101
00:06:09,300 --> 00:06:10,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I might just grant it.</font>

102
00:06:26,220 --> 00:06:26,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's wrong?</font>

103
00:06:28,340 --> 00:06:29,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is it hot here?</font>

104
00:06:30,380 --> 00:06:31,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's a bit stuffy in here.</font>

105
00:06:32,700 --> 00:06:33,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you realize</font>

106
00:06:33,140 --> 00:06:34,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you remind me of someone I once knew?</font>

107
00:06:35,980 --> 00:06:36,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just like you,</font>

108
00:06:37,860 --> 00:06:39,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">she always tied my sash
into a dead knot.</font>

109
00:06:45,020 --> 00:06:45,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is that so?</font>

110
00:06:46,180 --> 00:06:48,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It seems attending to dressing</font>

111
00:06:48,340 --> 00:06:49,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is not a task for just anyone.</font>

112
00:06:51,460 --> 00:06:53,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I taught her time and again,</font>

113
00:06:54,260 --> 00:06:55,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but she could never get it right.</font>

114
00:06:57,300 --> 00:06:58,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Once, I scolded her a little,</font>

115
00:06:59,180 --> 00:07:00,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and she said, fuming,</font>

116
00:07:01,540 --> 00:07:02,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that never again in this life</font>

117
00:07:02,780 --> 00:07:04,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">would she help me dress.</font>

118
00:07:21,140 --> 00:07:22,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness, what are you doing?</font>

119
00:07:22,740 --> 00:07:23,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Where is your birthmark?</font>

120
00:07:24,300 --> 00:07:25,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What birthmark?</font>

121
00:07:25,540 --> 00:07:27,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I wasn't born with one.</font>

122
00:07:31,940 --> 00:07:32,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness.</font>

123
00:07:33,020 --> 00:07:33,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Look.</font>

124
00:07:33,740 --> 00:07:34,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've finished helping you dress.</font>

125
00:07:35,100 --> 00:07:35,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Get out.</font>

126
00:07:36,100 --> 00:07:36,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Didn't you say...?</font>

127
00:07:36,980 --> 00:07:37,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I told you to get out.</font>

128
00:07:57,180 --> 00:07:57,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Li Congyao,</font>

129
00:07:58,540 --> 00:07:59,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qin Wei is already dead.</font>

130
00:08:05,740 --> 00:08:06,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness,</font>

131
00:08:07,220 --> 00:08:07,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">here's the medicine.</font>

132
00:08:19,580 --> 00:08:20,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It wasn't her after all.</font>

133
00:08:22,380 --> 00:08:23,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Since she's courting death,</font>

134
00:08:25,140 --> 00:08:26,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll let her die a deserved death.</font>

135
00:08:30,540 --> 00:08:31,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Fire! Fire!</font>

136
00:08:31,980 --> 00:08:33,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Quick, there's a fire!</font>

137
00:08:33,260 --> 00:08:34,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Fire! Fire!</font>

138
00:08:34,540 --> 00:08:35,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Find someone, quickly!</font>

139
00:08:35,020 --> 00:08:36,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come put out the fire!</font>

140
00:08:44,220 --> 00:08:46,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qinglan, what are you doing here?</font>

141
00:08:49,020 --> 00:08:50,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why keep a pot</font>

142
00:08:50,340 --> 00:08:51,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">of dead flowers here?</font>

143
00:08:51,860 --> 00:08:52,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What bad luck.</font>

144
00:08:53,260 --> 00:08:53,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mother.</font>

145
00:08:54,500 --> 00:08:56,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is no ordinary pot of flowers.</font>

146
00:08:56,740 --> 00:08:57,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's evidence of murder.</font>

147
00:08:58,220 --> 00:08:59,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Evidence of murder?</font>

148
00:09:01,340 --> 00:09:01,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then,</font>

149
00:09:02,100 --> 00:09:03,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">are these prescriptions of yours</font>

150
00:09:03,220 --> 00:09:04,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">also evidence of murder?</font>

151
00:09:04,540 --> 00:09:05,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Precisely.</font>

152
00:09:05,820 --> 00:09:06,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Within them</font>

153
00:09:06,780 --> 00:09:07,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">lies a hidden mystery.</font>

154
00:09:08,700 --> 00:09:09,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can you spot anything amiss?</font>

155
00:09:13,180 --> 00:09:14,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Isn't this just</font>

156
00:09:14,500 --> 00:09:15,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">a prescription for treating a cold?</font>

157
00:09:15,900 --> 00:09:16,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jun Qinglan.</font>

158
00:09:28,500 --> 00:09:30,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jinyi, to what do I owe</font>

159
00:09:30,660 --> 00:09:31,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">this late-night visit?</font>

160
00:09:31,740 --> 00:09:33,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Xizhao Princess's body
suddenly caught fire.</font>

161
00:09:33,660 --> 00:09:35,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You are the prime suspect.</font>

162
00:09:35,340 --> 00:09:36,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">By order of the Prince,</font>

163
00:09:36,580 --> 00:09:39,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I am to take you
to the Ministry of Justice for trial.</font>

164
00:09:39,700 --> 00:09:40,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Take her away.</font>

165
00:09:40,620 --> 00:09:42,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can the Prince arrest people on a whim?</font>

166
00:09:44,940 --> 00:09:47,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you seek death, I will grant it.</font>

167
00:09:47,980 --> 00:09:48,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't you touch my mother.</font>

168
00:09:50,500 --> 00:09:51,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll go with you, alright?</font>

169
00:10:00,140 --> 00:10:00,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Move.</font>

170
00:10:02,620 --> 00:10:03,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qinglan.</font>

171
00:10:04,220 --> 00:10:05,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qinglan!</font>

172
00:10:08,740 --> 00:10:10,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Let me go!
- Let me out!</font>

173
00:10:10,260 --> 00:10:11,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can't take it anymore.</font>

174
00:10:11,980 --> 00:10:13,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Help me!</font>

175
00:10:13,780 --> 00:10:15,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm begging you!</font>

176
00:10:16,740 --> 00:10:17,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Miss,</font>

177
00:10:19,700 --> 00:10:20,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you've led us the wrong way.</font>

178
00:10:21,460 --> 00:10:22,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That path leads to Death Row.</font>

179
00:10:23,100 --> 00:10:23,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's not wrong.</font>

180
00:10:24,940 --> 00:10:26,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Even if I burned the Princess's body,</font>

181
00:10:27,220 --> 00:10:28,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">it's surely not enough
to throw me on Death Row.</font>

182
00:10:29,220 --> 00:10:29,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm not going.</font>

183
00:10:30,340 --> 00:10:31,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you want to keep those arms,</font>

184
00:10:31,980 --> 00:10:33,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">take your filthy hands off her.</font>

185
00:10:34,180 --> 00:10:34,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Move!</font>

186
00:10:35,900 --> 00:10:36,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Chief!</font>

187
00:10:37,140 --> 00:10:37,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qinglan.</font>

188
00:10:38,180 --> 00:10:39,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mrs. Jun told me what happened,</font>

189
00:10:39,420 --> 00:10:40,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">so I rushed straight over.</font>

190
00:10:40,740 --> 00:10:41,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They didn't hurt you, did they?</font>

191
00:10:44,660 --> 00:10:46,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is my turf.</font>

192
00:10:46,780 --> 00:10:48,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And she's one of my people.</font>

193
00:10:48,580 --> 00:10:49,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't you dare lay a hand on her.</font>

194
00:10:50,300 --> 00:10:50,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qinglan, let's go.</font>

195
00:10:51,500 --> 00:10:52,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It seems Mr. Jiang</font>

196
00:10:53,100 --> 00:10:54,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is truly set on defying me.</font>

197
00:10:54,980 --> 00:10:56,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're the one looking for trouble.</font>

198
00:10:58,140 --> 00:10:58,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jun Qinglan.</font>

199
00:10:59,140 --> 00:11:00,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Court of Judicial Review</font>

200
00:11:00,620 --> 00:11:01,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">issues everyone the same items</font>

201
00:11:01,820 --> 00:11:03,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to carry on themselves.</font>

202
00:11:05,380 --> 00:11:06,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Where is your fire pouch?</font>

203
00:11:08,140 --> 00:11:08,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qinglan.</font>

204
00:11:09,020 --> 00:11:09,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Show it to him.</font>

205
00:11:15,380 --> 00:11:17,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This fire pouch was found
beside the Xizhao Princess's body.</font>

206
00:11:18,340 --> 00:11:20,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It belongs to your office.</font>

207
00:11:21,740 --> 00:11:22,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That doesn't prove</font>

208
00:11:22,500 --> 00:11:23,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qinglan burned the body.</font>

209
00:11:24,060 --> 00:11:25,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Perhaps someone is framing her.</font>

210
00:11:25,820 --> 00:11:26,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The coincidence is</font>

211
00:11:27,420 --> 00:11:29,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that only you and she
visited the morgue today.</font>

212
00:11:30,780 --> 00:11:31,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If it wasn't her,</font>

213
00:11:32,660 --> 00:11:33,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">could it be you?</font>

214
00:11:33,940 --> 00:11:34,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You...</font>

215
00:11:34,220 --> 00:11:34,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Chief.</font>

216
00:11:35,940 --> 00:11:37,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's just being thrown into Death Row.</font>

217
00:11:38,060 --> 00:11:39,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I have a clear conscience.</font>

218
00:11:40,060 --> 00:11:40,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll be fine.</font>

219
00:11:45,660 --> 00:11:46,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Very well.</font>

220
00:11:47,420 --> 00:11:48,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll entrust Qinglan to you.</font>

221
00:11:49,140 --> 00:11:50,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If she is harmed in the slightest,</font>

222
00:11:51,140 --> 00:11:52,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">all of your subordinates</font>

223
00:11:52,140 --> 00:11:52,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">will answer for it.</font>

224
00:11:59,060 --> 00:12:01,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You know I did not kill anyone,</font>

225
00:12:01,780 --> 00:12:03,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">yet you rush to pin the crime on me.</font>

226
00:12:04,620 --> 00:12:05,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It is simply</font>

227
00:12:05,980 --> 00:12:07,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">because the Princess's death</font>

228
00:12:07,620 --> 00:12:09,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is a knot you can never untie.</font>

229
00:12:10,580 --> 00:12:12,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You dare not let me find
the true killer,</font>

230
00:12:13,780 --> 00:12:14,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">because</font>

231
00:12:15,220 --> 00:12:16,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the real murderer</font>

232
00:12:17,340 --> 00:12:18,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is none other than you.</font>

233
00:12:20,700 --> 00:12:21,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then do tell me.</font>

234
00:12:22,740 --> 00:12:23,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How exactly did I</font>

235
00:12:23,780 --> 00:12:24,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">commit this murder?</font>

236
00:12:25,820 --> 00:12:27,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Given your status,</font>

237
00:12:27,500 --> 00:12:29,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you would never dirty your own hands.</font>

238
00:12:29,860 --> 00:12:31,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Princess's personal maid, Yunran,</font>

239
00:12:32,420 --> 00:12:34,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is the one who carried out the deed.</font>

240
00:12:34,420 --> 00:12:36,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Prescription]</font>

241
00:12:36,820 --> 00:12:38,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's just a cold.</font>

242
00:12:38,580 --> 00:12:39,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why so many prescriptions?</font>

243
00:12:39,900 --> 00:12:41,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yunran wasn't recovering,</font>

244
00:12:42,060 --> 00:12:43,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">so the physician
changed the prescriptions.</font>

245
00:12:44,340 --> 00:12:46,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yunran claimed she caught
a cold on the road</font>

246
00:12:46,940 --> 00:12:47,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and took medicine daily.</font>

247
00:12:48,580 --> 00:12:50,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yet, conveniently,
right after the Princess died,</font>

248
00:12:50,820 --> 00:12:51,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">her illness was cured.</font>

249
00:12:53,140 --> 00:12:54,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I went to Yucai Pharmacy</font>

250
00:12:54,380 --> 00:12:56,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and checked
all of Yunran's prescriptions.</font>

251
00:12:57,180 --> 00:12:58,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">In every single prescription,</font>

252
00:12:58,060 --> 00:12:59,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">there was one extra ingredient.</font>

253
00:13:00,380 --> 00:13:01,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Prescription]
And these herbs,</font>

254
00:13:01,860 --> 00:13:02,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">when combined together,</font>

255
00:13:02,500 --> 00:13:03,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">serve only one purpose:</font>

256
00:13:04,660 --> 00:13:05,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">To induce asthma.</font>

257
00:13:07,860 --> 00:13:08,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go on.</font>

258
00:13:09,180 --> 00:13:09,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">At the same time,</font>

259
00:13:10,340 --> 00:13:13,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the Princess's pillow just happened</font>

260
00:13:13,300 --> 00:13:14,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to have a few holes in it.</font>

261
00:13:14,740 --> 00:13:16,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The cotton and goose down inside,</font>

262
00:13:16,380 --> 00:13:17,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">for someone with asthma,</font>

263
00:13:17,940 --> 00:13:19,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is a lethal trigger.</font>

264
00:13:23,940 --> 00:13:24,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Later,</font>

265
00:13:24,740 --> 00:13:26,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yunran poured the medicine</font>

266
00:13:26,180 --> 00:13:28,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">into the rose flower pot
by the Princess's bed.</font>

267
00:13:28,820 --> 00:13:30,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">As the water evaporated,</font>

268
00:13:30,580 --> 00:13:32,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the Princess
unknowingly inhaled the drug,</font>

269
00:13:33,060 --> 00:13:34,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">triggering an asthma attack.</font>

270
00:13:35,980 --> 00:13:36,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">During the autopsy,</font>

271
00:13:37,300 --> 00:13:38,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I saw the Princess's condition.</font>

272
00:13:38,900 --> 00:13:40,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She died of suffocation.</font>

273
00:13:46,940 --> 00:13:47,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Brilliant.</font>

274
00:13:49,060 --> 00:13:50,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So young,</font>

275
00:13:51,220 --> 00:13:51,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">yet so clever</font>

276
00:13:52,820 --> 00:13:53,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and so patient.</font>

277
00:13:54,900 --> 00:13:55,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I find myself</font>

278
00:13:57,180 --> 00:13:58,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">reluctant to kill you now.</font>

279
00:13:59,140 --> 00:14:00,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You suspected this all along,
didn't you?</font>

280
00:14:01,260 --> 00:14:02,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's why you ordered Jinyi</font>

281
00:14:02,740 --> 00:14:04,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to burn the Princess's body.</font>

282
00:14:04,900 --> 00:14:05,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That way,</font>

283
00:14:06,100 --> 00:14:08,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">even if I find the cause of death,</font>

284
00:14:08,780 --> 00:14:10,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">there will be no body to examine.</font>

285
00:14:11,140 --> 00:14:12,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You also stole</font>

286
00:14:12,460 --> 00:14:14,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the fire pouch from me</font>

287
00:14:14,620 --> 00:14:16,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">when I went to your residence today.</font>

288
00:14:17,700 --> 00:14:18,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Get out.</font>

289
00:14:19,060 --> 00:14:19,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Back then,</font>

290
00:14:20,620 --> 00:14:21,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I was chosen by you</font>

291
00:14:21,860 --> 00:14:23,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">as the scapegoat, wasn't I?</font>

292
00:14:23,860 --> 00:14:24,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How did you know</font>

293
00:14:25,260 --> 00:14:26,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">it was Jinyi who burned the body?</font>

294
00:14:28,020 --> 00:14:30,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've spent years among the dead.</font>

295
00:14:30,940 --> 00:14:32,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The smell of kerosene on her</font>

296
00:14:32,740 --> 00:14:34,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is mixed with burnt flesh.</font>

297
00:14:35,180 --> 00:14:36,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It couldn't fool me.</font>

298
00:14:56,980 --> 00:14:58,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I have clearly underestimated you.</font>

299
00:15:07,900 --> 00:15:09,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It hasn't even landed on you,</font>

300
00:15:10,100 --> 00:15:11,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and you're already trembling.</font>

301
00:15:12,660 --> 00:15:13,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't push yourself.</font>

302
00:15:14,940 --> 00:15:15,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tell me.</font>

303
00:15:17,180 --> 00:15:18,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Where is the flower pot hidden?</font>

304
00:15:19,780 --> 00:15:20,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That way,</font>

305
00:15:22,020 --> 00:15:23,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll grant you a swift end.</font>

306
00:15:24,540 --> 00:15:25,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Despicable.</font>

307
00:15:27,780 --> 00:15:29,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So many have cursed me,</font>

308
00:15:30,260 --> 00:15:32,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but that was the gentlest I've heard.</font>

309
00:15:36,620 --> 00:15:39,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Princess Changle is here!</font>

310
00:15:50,940 --> 00:15:52,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness, to what do I owe</font>

311
00:15:53,260 --> 00:15:54,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">your late-night visit?</font>

312
00:15:55,300 --> 00:15:57,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've long heard
of your ruthless methods.</font>

313
00:15:58,620 --> 00:16:00,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Seeing it firsthand
truly surpasses the tales.</font>

314
00:16:01,260 --> 00:16:02,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're even personally torturing</font>

315
00:16:03,540 --> 00:16:05,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">a mere coroner.</font>

316
00:16:06,740 --> 00:16:08,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My late wife's bones are not yet cold,</font>

317
00:16:08,540 --> 00:16:09,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and now she suffers this desecration.</font>

318
00:16:10,740 --> 00:16:12,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I cannot simply stand by and watch.</font>

319
00:16:14,500 --> 00:16:16,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you implying</font>

320
00:16:17,060 --> 00:16:19,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that this coroner destroyed the remains?</font>

321
00:16:20,100 --> 00:16:21,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Any motive?</font>

322
00:16:22,100 --> 00:16:23,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm interrogating her now.</font>

323
00:16:23,460 --> 00:16:25,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But Jiang Yufan reported to me</font>

324
00:16:25,660 --> 00:16:28,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that Jun Qinglan has found
the real culprit.</font>

325
00:16:29,060 --> 00:16:31,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So, I requested His Majesty's permission</font>

326
00:16:31,220 --> 00:16:33,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to hold the joint trial tomorrow.</font>

327
00:16:34,260 --> 00:16:35,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Whatever you wish to ask,</font>

328
00:16:35,860 --> 00:16:37,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">save it for tomorrow.</font>

329
00:16:47,740 --> 00:16:48,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Li Congyao,</font>

330
00:16:49,420 --> 00:16:50,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">there's no escape for you.</font>

331
00:16:52,460 --> 00:16:54,310
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪We'll see all the world's sights♪</font>

332
00:16:55,330 --> 00:16:56,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Drifting with the clouds♪</font>

333
00:16:56,990 --> 00:17:00,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Leave our names etched
in each other's hearts♪</font>

334
00:17:00,920 --> 00:17:05,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Bright as a goddess, stirring my soul♪</font>

335
00:17:05,600 --> 00:17:08,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Each stroke inscribed
into the passing years♪</font>

336
00:17:09,580 --> 00:17:13,710
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪A sky full of stars covers
the peach blossom spring♪</font>

337
00:17:14,110 --> 00:17:18,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪With you, hand in hand
across the vast world♪</font>

338
00:17:18,440 --> 00:17:24,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪No words needed,
our hearts mirror each other♪</font>

339
00:17:26,570 --> 00:17:30,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Catching a teardrop on my fingertip♪</font>

340
00:17:31,250 --> 00:17:34,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Then gently caressing your face♪</font>

341
00:17:35,290 --> 00:17:39,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪We await mercy
as the rain flutters down♪</font>

342
00:17:39,840 --> 00:17:42,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪This floating life
is like a myriad of dreams♪</font>

343
00:17:43,820 --> 00:17:48,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪No matter how far the journey,
our passion endures♪</font>

344
00:17:48,420 --> 00:17:52,190
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Let's turn a blind eye
to all the gossip and rumors♪</font>
